Cell["\<\
The indicator is +1 for real representations, 0 for complex representations, \
and -1 for pseudoreal representations.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1846763481,ExpressionUUID->"1c15a292-c8be-4206-8ea1-271e81aebf6a"],

